{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/3024e81cbbc7a7945fa759617e628667.avif?t=1769154856\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a calm, cozy evening, you and your friends (or maybe just you) decide to put your nerves to the ultimate test. Some aim to climb higher and higher, while others do everything they can to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/bb4e47f16fee292d98c99a9e223124bc.poster.avif?t=1769154856\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/bb4e47f16fee292d98c99a9e223124bc.webm?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/bb4e47f16fee292d98c99a9e223124bc.mp4?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up, fix your hair, or put on a hat. Strike a pose and you\u2019re already halfway to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gymnastic skills to claim victory - or to ruin one of your friend\u2019s moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/b7fe346f175ea6d8494cab29f1a12d95.poster.avif?t=1769154856\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/b7fe346f175ea6d8494cab29f1a12d95.webm?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/b7fe346f175ea6d8494cab29f1a12d95.mp4?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in whatever game mode suits you best.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love risk and speed? The timed mode is for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a calm evening where mistakes aren\u2019t scary? The resurrection mode is a perfect fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for competition? The free-for-all mode will show who among your friends is the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craving extreme challenges? The hardcore mode will make a single mistake bring you a whole palette of emotions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s a mode for everyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/9f69f47e45cf59d76dda1a72d94d6deb.poster.avif?t=1769154856\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/9f69f47e45cf59d76dda1a72d94d6deb.webm?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/9f69f47e45cf59d76dda1a72d94d6deb.mp4?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember - one mistake, and you\u2019ve already messed up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/abf73e0d90873739b594cbc5b1cf16bd.poster.avif?t=1769154856\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936900/extras/abf73e0d90873739b594cbc5b1cf16bd.webm?t=1769154856\" type=\"video/web